---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { AUTHOR_NAME } from '../consts';
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="About the engineer behind this site.">
  <section class="shell narrow page-intro">
    <p class="eyebrow">ABOUT</p>
    <h1>{AUTHOR_NAME}</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      I write about software engineering, data systems, architecture, and the practical use of AI in professional engineering teams.
    </p>
    <p>
      This site is deliberately implementation-focused: mental models, engineering trade-offs, workflows, experiments, and lessons that can be applied to real repositories.
    </p>
    <p class="callout">
      Before publishing, replace this page with your own short professional biography. Keep it specific: what you build, what you lead, and what you are currently learning.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
